<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Covey started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Covey started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney initiated coverage of Franklin Covey Co with a neutral rating, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Franklin Covey gained 1/8 to 24-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
